      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The Australia Institute of Business and Technology is one of Australia's top private vocational education providers. Founded in 2015, the institute has recruited over 10,000 international students from over 80 different countries around the world.</p><p>Modern campuses are situated in Brisbane, Sydney and Hobart, with AIBT-accredited courses offering the same nationally recognised qualifications available through TAFE.</p><p>AIBT offers the practical experience of simulated labs, training restaurants and engineering workshops to help students gain invaluable employable skills aligned with current industry standards. The high-tech virtual classrooms allow online students to attend real-time/recorded classes anywhere globally. AIBT is well-funded, so students can use the latest software and hardware available. Student lounges and relaxing common areas are provided in addition to food places for students to rest and recharge.</p>",
