    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>Australia Institute of Business and Technology (AIBT) offers an exciting range of accommodation options to cater to its students' diverse needs and preferences. On-campus housing provides students with the convenience of living in well-furnished rooms that are comfortable and equipped with modern amenities. The accommodation is close to the institute's facilities and resources, and statistics show that students living on campus are more likely to succeed academically. AIBT can assist students who need to find suitable accommodation in surrounding areas, with off-campus options including rental apartments, shared houses, and private accommodations.</p>",
